sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant OB as Outbox publisher
  participant SB as Service Bus
  participant Worker
  Client->>API: POST /v1/scans Idempotency-Key optional
  API->>DB: derive tenant, authorize target, lock quota month
  API->>DB: insert scans PENDING, billing_state RESERVED
  API->>DB: insert scan_reserved + idempotency + outbox event
  OB->>SB: publish scan.requested version 2026-05-06-production-hardening-v5
  Worker->>SB: accept tenant session
  Worker->>DB: beginAttempt PENDING -> IN_PROGRESS
  Worker->>Worker: run modules + retry/backoff + timeouts
  Worker->>DB: scan_results + scan_attempts + DONE/FAILED
  Worker->>DB: scan_consumed or scan_refunded
  Client->>API: GET /v1/scans/{scanId} and PDF